    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Schema and Card View Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this bot to think through which fields from your dataset should appear in your dashboard. It can help you decide which fields to keep in your schema and how those fields might appear on a card.\r\n\r\nAdd your `planning.md` and `dataset.js` files to the chat so the bot can use your project idea and dataset.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n- Can you help me decide which fields from my dataset are most useful for my dashboard?\r\n- Can you help me connect my dataset fields to a simple card layout?\r\n:::",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
